  "creator": "CrossFit",
  "description": "A crossing ladder: squat cleans at 185/125 lb go 1 to 10 while parallette handstand push-ups go 10 down to 1. Honours U.S. Marine Lance Cpl. Justin James \"JJ\" Wilson, killed in Helmand Province, Afghanistan, in 2010. 55 of each; scale the handstand push-ups to a regular deficit or the floor.",
